.mistlane-series-page
  header.mistlane-feature-intro
    span.mistlane-feature-eyebrow LEARNING PATHS
    h1 把零散文章连成可以持续阅读的路径
    p 按顺序阅读算法模板、竞赛题解与前端学习笔记，也可以随时从上次的位置继续。
  if page.seriesGroups && page.seriesGroups.length
    .mistlane-series-grid
      each group in page.seriesGroups
        article.mistlane-series-card(id=`series-${group.slug}`)
          header
            .mistlane-series-heading
              span.mistlane-series-icon
                i.fas.fa-layer-group
              div
                h2= group.name
                p= group.description || `${group.count} 篇文章组成的学习路径`
            span.mistlane-series-count= `${group.count} 篇`
          ol.mistlane-series-list
            each item in group.posts
              li
                span.mistlane-series-index= String(item.index).padStart(2, '0')
                a(href=url_for(item.path))
                  strong= item.title
                  if item.description
                    small= strip_html(item.description)
          footer
            span
              i.far.fa-clock
              |  更新于 #{date(group.latest, 'YYYY-MM-DD')}
            a(href=url_for(group.posts[0].path)) 开始阅读
  else
    .mistlane-empty-state
      i.fas.fa-route
      strong 暂无学习路径
      p 给文章 front matter 添加 series 后会自动出现在这里。
